Subject: [PATCH 2/2] android/tester: Fix race in discovering devices
Date: Thu, 21 Dec 2017 21:44:13 +0100
Message-Id: <20171221204413.20998-2-szymon.janc@codecoup.pl>
In-Reply-To: <20171221204413.20998-1-szymon.janc@codecoup.pl>
